  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 404.06 PWS Capacity Assurance",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 404.06 PWS Capacity Assurance. A proposed PWS shall meet the requirements of Env- Dw 602 relative to capacity assurance in order to receive design approval from the department.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 404) #10611, eff 6-1-14\n\nNew. #14158, eff 12-25-24",
